FFmpeg master 9181f3a92495 (2026-10-10), not in release/9.0 after 9.0.2:
https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commit/9181f3a92495e93c4bf0a1bcab00992ed59397d1

mov: rebuilding the index walked the time-to-sample table from the first sample
for every edit of a track with composition offsets; an 800 kB file with 50000
edits over 200000 samples took 58 s to open (ffprobe, ffmpeg -i of an upload).
The position is now computed directly.

